ff-s-office-warns-truckers-after-ticketing-driver-o-c783714194/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/dekalb-county-sheriff-s-office-warns-truckers-after-ticketing-driver-o-c783714194/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:12:34 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Shaw Local</description></item><item><title>Teamsters strike at Associated Grocers enters second week</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/teamsters-strike-at-associated-grocers-enters-second-week-1829c5f30d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/teamsters-strike-at-associated-grocers-enters-second-week-1829c5f30d/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:00:00 +0000</pubDate><category>Drivers &amp; Jobs</category><description>Concord Monitor</description></item><item><title>298,988-squarefoot warehouse proposed in Orange, neighbors are raising concerns about truck traffic</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/298-988-squarefoot-warehouse-proposed-in-orange-neighbors-are-raising-6569f00a45/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/298-988-squarefoot-warehouse-proposed-in-orange-neighbors-are-raising-6569f00a45/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:08:14 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Orange County Register</description></item><item><title>Diesel Prices Are Surging. This Electric Trucking Company Is Seeing More Interest</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-prices-are-surging-this-electric-trucking-company-is-seeing-mor-e4305287dd/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-prices-are-surging-this-electric-trucking-company-is-seeing-mor-e4305287dd/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:03:12 +0000</pubDate><category>Fuel</category><description>InsideEVs</description></item><item><title>Field to Freight: John Deere Connects Farm Production With Renewable Diesel Alternatives</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/field-to-freight-john-deere-connects-farm-production-with-renewable-di-603b7445cc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/field-to-freight-john-deere-connects-farm-production-with-renewable-di-603b7445cc/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:03:03 +0000</pubDate><category>Fuel</category><description>John Deere is testing 100% biodiesel (B100) in five semi-trucks for six months under its Field to Freight initiative, according to an RFD-TV interview with John Deere Biofuels Director Nate Green. The trucks deliver parts and equipment to dealers and farmers from the company&#x27;s distribution center in Milan, Illinois, and were fitted with an upgrade kit installed by Optimus Technologies. Penske, CPC Logistics and Chevron are also involved, with Chevron supplying the biodiesel.

The trucks use a dual-tank system to start on diesel and switch to B100 once the engine warms, and they recirculate diesel at shutdown. Green said the demonstration will show whether the technology works within the company&#x27;s logistics network, and John Deere would consider wider deployment if it does. He also said full life-cycle greenhouse gas emissions from biodiesel can be 50% to 85% lower than petroleum diesel, depending on feedstock.</description></item><item><title>Ramstad: From trucker to economist, Morris professor tracked an industry in transition</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/ramstad-from-trucker-to-economist-morris-professor-tracked-an-industry-1fd31cf7c5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/ramstad-from-trucker-to-economist-morris-professor-tracked-an-industry-1fd31cf7c5/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Star Tribune</description></item><item><title>Federal appeals court sides with New York state over truck driver&#x27;s licenses for immigrants</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/federal-appeals-court-sides-with-new-york-state-over-truck-driver-s-li-32a9627a37/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/federal-appeals-court-sides-with-new-york-state-over-truck-driver-s-li-32a9627a37/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:14:14 +0000</pubDate><category>Regulations</category><description>kens5.com</description></item><item><title>Load Planner (Supply Chain/Logistics) in Beachwood, OH for Penske Truck Leasing</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/load-planner-supply-chain-logistics-in-beachwood-oh-for-penske-truck-l-99219de393/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/load-planner-supply-chain-logistics-in-beachwood-oh-for-penske-truck-l-99219de393/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 09:45:36 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Transport Topics</description></item><item><title>High diesel prices hi